" sista åt apan. Jag är nästan säker på att min nuvarande utgrävningsplats är"
" ägnad åt kondoren."

msgctxt "407R41C"
msgid ""
"Further, it seems that these people were also adept astronomers, and like "
"the Inca after them, they constructed ritual observatories where they would "
"worship at intervals based on the movement of the stars and sun. These "
"ritual observatories were locked to all but the high priests, and to ensure "
